        <item>
            <title>0.23</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:46:45 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202609101446</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.23</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Updates re-plan rather than reset: settled minions stay, walkers keep their destination; core tiles stop replaying their build; couches drawn by wall, not by index</li>
<li>Crates are carried to the slot the yard layout will give them, so nothing jumps on landing; lifting is a crouch with the crate passing the chest</li>
<li>Dorm and bath placed beside the lounge, existing layouts re-clustered; one minion to a couch</li>
<li>Rules for idleness: read on the couch by day, sleep by night, showers after long work, pees after short, loungers now and then</li>
<li>The bath's pixel patch sits where it should; a visit is a pee at the bowl or a shower under falling pixels</li>
<li>Doorways through the yard, a bath with pixel static, a livelier lounge, my name on my offices</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
